Make the build find OpenEnclave, at an overridable prefix.

The published artifact does not build as shipped: it includes <mbedtls/error.h>
and links -lmbedcrypto, but OpenEnclave installs mbedtls under its own 3rdparty
tree rather than on the system include/library path, so the build stops at
common/error.c with "mbedtls/error.h: No such file or directory".

Two changes, both pointing at the same install:
  * add $(OE_PREFIX)/include/openenclave/3rdparty to CPPFLAGS
  * link the host against OpenEnclave's own libmbedcrypto.a instead of a
    system -lmbedcrypto that is not present

OE_PREFIX defaults to /opt/openenclave (where the open-enclave package puts it,
and where the Dockerfile installs it); override it for a different install, e.g.
  make OE_PREFIX=$HOME/openenclave-install

-D OE_SIMULATION_CERT selects the self-signed path in enclave/mpi_tls.c instead
of generating an attested TLS certificate.  Upstream sets exactly this flag in
the sibling tpch_q5/our_2/Makefile of the same artifact.  Built without it, the
host aborts during enclave setup, before any query runs -- measured here:

  enclave/mpi_tls.c:358: oe_get_attestation_cert_buf_with_evidence_v2: OE_QUOTE_PROVIDER_LOAD_ERROR
  enclave/mpi_tls.c:402: Failed to load certificate and private key
  enclave/parallel_enc.c:47: Error initializing MPI-over-TLS
  host/parallel.c:287: Error in enclave joining initialization

i.e. it needs a provisioned DCAP quote provider.  These are single-node runs, so
the MPI-over-TLS channel has no remote peer to attest to; the flag removes an
attestation dependency, not a step the measured workload depends on.

HOSTONLY_LDLIBS (a separate non-enclave target we never build) is left alone.

--- a/join/Makefile
+++ b/join/Makefile
@@ -48,9 +48,14 @@
 LIBOBLIVIOUS_LIB = $(LIBOBLIVIOUS)/liboblivious.a
 THIRD_PARTY_LIBS = $(LIBOBLIVIOUS_LIB)

+# OpenEnclave ships mbedtls under its own 3rdparty include tree; without this
+# the build stops at common/error.c with 'mbedtls/error.h: No such file'.
+OE_PREFIX ?= /opt/openenclave
+
 CPPFLAGS = -I. \
-	-I$(LIBOBLIVIOUS)/include
-CFLAGS = -march=native -mno-avx512f -O3 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -D PRE_ALLOCATION
+	-I$(LIBOBLIVIOUS)/include \
+	-I$(OE_PREFIX)/include/openenclave/3rdparty
+CFLAGS = -march=native -mno-avx512f -O3 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -D PRE_ALLOCATION -D OE_SIMULATION_CERT
 LDFLAGS = \
 	-L$(LIBOBLIVIOUS)
 LDLIBS = \
@@ -101,7 +106,7 @@
 HOST_LDLIBS = \
 	$(shell pkg-config mpi --libs) \
 	$(shell pkg-config oehost-$(C_COMPILER) --libs) \
-	-lmbedcrypto \
+	$(OE_PREFIX)/lib/openenclave/enclave/libmbedcrypto.a \
 	$(LDLIBS)

 $(HOST_DIR)/%.o: $(HOST_DIR)/%.c
